noma, stage II. Her blood pressure was 114/72, and she weighed 194 pounds. She was diagnosed with Melanoma cancer, stage II, and underwent treatment approximately 1.4 years ago.\n\nSocial history indicates that Ms. Martin consumes alcohol at a rate of approximately 8 drinks per week.\n\nThank you for considering this detailed medical report your records. Please let me know if you need any further information.\n\nSincerely,\n\nDr. Tiffany Roberson Lee and Liu Medical Group\n"
